# Teams Lite (#78) — backend configuration for the ENROLLED path only.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill in for a dev build. An unconfigured
# build (neither set) has NO backend: enrollment reports "not set up" and the
# Free/unenrolled mode never makes a network call.
#
# ⚠️  NEVER put the Supabase SERVICE-ROLE key here or anywhere in the extension.
#     The extension uses ONLY the ANON (publishable) key + its per-install
#     credential. The service-role key lives ONLY in the edge-function server
#     environment (`supabase secrets set` / the dashboard), never in the client.

# Supabase functions base URL.
#   • Local `supabase functions serve` default:
VITE_TEAMS_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
#   • A real project would be: https://<project-ref>.supabase.co

# Supabase ANON (publishable) key — PUBLIC, safe to ship in the extension.
# From `supabase status` (local) or Project Settings → API (hosted).
VITE_TEAMS_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
